# Check out text files with LF on every platform, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# Hook scripts with CRLF fail on bash outside Git for Windows (WSL, Cygwin, a copied cache) and a
# hook that crashes does not block the tool call, so a CRLF guard silently stops guarding.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
